<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    {{> layout/head-meta}}
    <title>포인트 관리 | Busan Play</title>
    <style>
        .point-page { padding: 44px 24px 60px; background: #f8f9fb; color: #292f3d; font-family: 'Pretendard',sans-serif; }
        .point-page * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        .point-wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; }
        .point-crumb { color: #647596; font-size: 13px; }
        .point-crumb a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
        .point-page h1 { margin: 24px 0 10px; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -1px; }
        .point-description { color: #72757e; line-height: 1.7; }
        .point-balance { margin: 28px 0; padding: 28px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #e7e1d7; background: #f3efe8; color: #292f3d; }
        .point-balance h2 { font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
        .point-balance strong { display: block; font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .point-balance p { color: #72716e; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px; }
        .point-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 10px; background: #0750d8; color: white; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
        .point-balance .point-link { background: #0750d8; color: white; }
        .point-columns { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .point-history { padding: 26px; border: 1px solid #e6e7eb; border-radius: 20px; background: white; }
        .point-history h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 20px; }
        .point-sample { padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: #eeede9; color: #63625e; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
        .point-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ececef; }
        .point-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .point-row strong { display: block; font-size: 14px; }
        .point-row small { display: block; color: #72757e; margin-top: 7px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .point-amount { color: #3d725c; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 700; }
        .point-amount.used { color: #b54747; }
        .point-page a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #9cbfff; outline-offset: 4px; }
        @media(max-width:650px) { .point-page { padding: 30px 16px 40px; } .point-columns { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .point-history,.point-balance { padding: 22px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
{{> layout/header}}
{{> layout/account-style}}
<main class="point-page">
    <div class="account-layout">
        {{> layout/account-nav}}
    <div class="point-wrap account-content">
        <nav class="point-crumb" aria-label="현재 위치"><a href="/mypage">마이페이지</a> / 포인트 관리</nav>
        <h1>포인트 관리</h1>
        <p class="point-description">포인트를 충전하고 충전·사용 내역을 확인하세요.</p>
        <section class="point-balance" aria-labelledby="balance-title">
            <h2 id="balance-title">보유 포인트</h2>
            {{#myPage}}<strong class="point-number">{{point}}</strong>{{/myPage}}
            {{^myPage}}<strong>잔액 조회 준비 중</strong><p>현재 보유 포인트는 마이페이지 또는 충전 화면에서 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>{{/myPage}}
            <a class="point-link" href="/charge">포인트 충전하기 →</a>
        </section>
        <p class="point-sample" role="status">충전 내역은 조회 연결 준비 중입니다. 행사 구매 내역은 서버에서 전달받은 목록을 표시합니다.</p>
        <div class="point-columns">

            <section class="point-history" aria-labelledby="charge-history-title">
                <h2 id="charge-history-title">충전 내역</h2>
            </section>
            {{#paymentList}}
                <div class="point-row">
                    <div>
                        <strong>포인트 충전</strong>
                        <small>
                            충전일 :
                            {{#paidAt}}
                                {{paidAt}}
                            {{/paidAt}}

                            {{^paidAt}}
                                충전일 확인 중
                            {{/paidAt}}
                        </small>
                    </div>
                    <span class="point-amount">+<span class="point-number">{{amount}}</span></span>
                </div>
            {{/paymentList}}

            {{^paymentList}}
                <p class="point-description">포인트 충전 내역이 없습니다.</p>
            {{/paymentList}}

            <section class="point-history" aria-labelledby="use-history-title">
                <h2 id="use-history-title">행사 구매 내역</h2>
                {{#purchaseList}}
                <div class="point-row"><div><strong>{{title}}</strong><small>{{sessionName}} · {{#purchaseDate}}{{purchaseDate}}{{/purchaseDate}}{{^purchaseDate}}구매일 확인 중{{/purchaseDate}}</small></div><span class="point-amount used">−<span class="point-number">{{price}}</span></span></div>
                {{/purchaseList}}
                {{^purchaseList}}<p class="point-description">표시할 구매 내역이 없습니다. 목록 조회 연결이 필요할 수 있습니다.</p>{{/purchaseList}}
            </section>
        </div>
        <p class="point-description">환불 및 전체 포인트 변동 내역 조회는 준비 중입니다.</p>
        <a class="point-link" href="/mypage">마이페이지로 돌아가기</a>
    </div>
    </div>
</main>
{{> layout/footer}}
<script>
document.querySelectorAll('.point-number').forEach(element => {
    const amount = Number(element.textContent.trim());
    if(Number.isFinite(amount)) element.textContent = amount.toLocaleString('ko-KR') + 'P';
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
